        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-28T06:15:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t really understand what a caller is supposed to do if this method returns false and now is probably a good time to clean this up. We typically don\u0027t have any need for backward compatibility of API in services/, is this case different and if it is how strong is that need ?",
