    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "8b94efa5_9ccd0c77",
        "filename": "services/net/java/android/net/apf/ApfGenerator.java",
        "patchSetId": 7
      },
      "lineNbr": 369,
      "author": {
        "id": 1273909
      },
      "writtenOn": "2018-03-30T04:20:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, I think checking for an *exact* version of the APF interpreter was needlessly strict, which is why I\u0027m relaxing the check to require a minimum version. We can certainly add new opcodes in a backwards-compatible way.\n\nIf setApfVersion() returns false, we disable APF filters altogether:\n\nhttps://cs.corp.google.com/android/frameworks/base/services/net/java/android/net/apf/ApfFilter.java?q\u003dsetApfVersion\u0026l\u003d1186\n\nI will send the change to relax the version check separately because it\u0027s a pre-requisite to submit aosp/642746.",
      "parentUuid": "10da869a_fc014bfa",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 368,
        "startChar": 72,
        "endLine": 369,
